/-!
# Erdos 1186 - `δ 3 = 117/2192`, with the five finite certificates (lane excert, night 3)

Formalises the proof claimed on erdosproblems.com/1186 (Proof claims, 2026-10-05, unrefereed); the mathematics is
its author's.  `P1186ExMain.delta3_eq_of_regions` has the five `RegionLB` statements as its only hypotheses; the
modules `P1186ExCert{1..5}` (generated by `problems/1186/exact/lean_cert_ex.py`, soundness in
`P1186ExCert{Lib,Alg,Chk,Tri,Pk}.lean`) prove them by `decide +kernel`.  Nothing is left open: this is the upstream
